  "title": "Coast Guard Air Station Humboldt Bay Rescues Injured Hiker",
  "description": "A Coast Guard Air Station Humboldt Bay aircrew rescues an injured hiker near Shelter Cove, Calif., Wednesday, March 27, 2013. Coast Guard Group Humboldt Bay received the medical evacuation request from California Department of Fire and Forestry Protection and launched an MH-65 Dolphin helicopter crew to hoist the hiker from the beach. He was transported to Group Humboldt Bay and transferred to emergency medical specialists. U.S. Coast Guard video",
